NOTICE — agent harness snapshot
================================

This directory contains a trimmed copy of benchmark-related modules originally
developed as part of the broader "dagent" agent framework.

Upstream attribution (conceptual lineage):

  - Yepeng Ding and contributors (authors listed in the upstream dagent pyproject).

The full dagent codebase is intentionally not shipped here; only paths needed
for NetAgentBench multi-turn evaluation via FastAPI (/benchmark/solve,
/benchmark/generate, /benchmark/health) are included.
